                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0470bf48-9eae-3dba-a94d-90da453cc26b",
                        "entry_id": "5995d022-784d-3ff8-8ad0-69ddb81fb70c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone or something that yields a crop or other product."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "32d34bd6-9262-4a3f-81bd-19d5ba1525aa",
                                "sense_id": "0470bf48-9eae-3dba-a94d-90da453cc26b",
                                "text": "Out of the whole ninety-five [cows] there were eight in particular […] who, though the teats of one or two were as hard as carrots, gave down to her with a readiness that made her work on them a mere touch of the fingers. Knowing, however, the dairyman’s wish, she endeavoured conscientiously to take the animals just as they came, excepting the very hard yielders which she could not yet manage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c950928b-d784-4301-97a2-d9b013b55e71",
                                "sense_id": "0470bf48-9eae-3dba-a94d-90da453cc26b",
                                "text": "Just as with the Irish potato, it is important to know how good a yielder you are planting."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "042032b3-4462-4a14-89be-bb22b20af8f8",
                                "sense_id": "0470bf48-9eae-3dba-a94d-90da453cc26b",
                                "text": "This variety is a very heavy yielder, has good drought-resistant qualities, and withstands wind and weather so well that it may be said to be storm-proof."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "45e6f76a-e413-3ece-8fb3-10650f933679",
                        "entry_id": "5995d022-784d-3ff8-8ad0-69ddb81fb70c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone or something that yields, or gives way."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cdc0dd2f-9319-4aa1-837f-7bc8039dcbdf",
                                "sense_id": "45e6f76a-e413-3ece-8fb3-10650f933679",
                                "text": "Their sense thus weak, lost with their fears thus strong,\nMade senseless things begin to do them wrong;\nFor briers and thorns at their apparel snatch;\nSome sleeves, some hats, from yielders all things catch."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "228b27bd-5cca-4f39-b154-7aa11dac3b3a",
                                "sense_id": "45e6f76a-e413-3ece-8fb3-10650f933679",
                                "text": "I am a modest man, sir, and hesitate to talk about myself even among friends; but since you all insist, there is nothing for me to do but yield as gracefully as I may--and as a yielder I glitter in the front rank."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
